  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "m29-s001",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-a",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 6680,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Thanks all. This is the review of the southern depots cutover, and a welcome to Aurelia."
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s002",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-c",
      "startMs": 6930,
      "endMs": 13610,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Thanks. I'm Aurelia Grant, I joined Halden in June as integration lead, taking over from Ravi."
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s003",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-b",
      "startMs": 13860,
      "endMs": 17500,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Aurelia reports to me, same as Ravi did."
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s004",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-a",
      "startMs": 17750,
      "endMs": 21010,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Welcome. JJ, how did the cutover go?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s005",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-d",
      "startMs": 21260,
      "endMs": 30980,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "The southern depots cut over on July 20, three days later than planned, because of a carrier data issue. Since then it's been clean."
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s006",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-b",
      "startMs": 31230,
      "endMs": 35630,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Three days late is fine. Nothing broke for the drivers."
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s007",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-a",
      "startMs": 35880,
      "endMs": 39900,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "So every region is now on the new optimizer?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s008",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-d",
      "startMs": 40150,
      "endMs": 41890,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Yes, all regions."
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s009",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-b",
      "startMs": 42140,
      "endMs": 48440,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Then I want the old optimizer gone. We decommission the old optimizer by September 30."
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s010",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-a",
      "startMs": 48690,
      "endMs": 51190,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Decided. What's left before that?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s011",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-c",
      "startMs": 51440,
      "endMs": 60780,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "The rollback runbook. Ravi's draft was never finished. I'll close out the rollback runbook by August 7, since it's still needed until decommission."
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s012",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-b",
      "startMs": 61030,
      "endMs": 63150,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Good, it's yours now."
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s013",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-e",
      "startMs": 63400,
      "endMs": 72360,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "On the commercial side, the old license runs to the end of the year. I'll renegotiate the license termination by August 14."
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s014",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-a",
      "startMs": 72610,
      "endMs": 75870,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Do you need anything from us, Sarah?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s015",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-e",
      "startMs": 76120,
      "endMs": 80900,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "A letter confirming the migration is complete. That helps the negotiation."
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s016",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-a",
      "startMs": 81150,
      "endMs": 84410,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I'll send you that letter by Monday."
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s017",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-d",
      "startMs": 84660,
      "endMs": 90960,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "One thing for Aurelia, the depot mappings walkthrough Ravi recorded is on the shared drive."
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s018",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-c",
      "startMs": 91210,
      "endMs": 94090,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Thanks, I've watched it twice already."
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s019",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-b",
      "startMs": 94340,
      "endMs": 101780,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Aurelia prefers a quick call over long email threads, so don't be shy about picking up the phone."
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s020",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-c",
      "startMs": 102030,
      "endMs": 106430,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "It's true. Ten minutes on a call beats twenty emails."
    },
    {
      "id": "m29-s021",
      "speakerId": "m29-spk-a",
      "startMs": 106680,
      "endMs": 112600,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Understood. So: decommission by September 30, runbook by August 7, license by August 14."
    }
  ],
  "note": {
    "version": 1,
    "body": "# Halden southern depots cutover review\n\n**Date:** July 23\n**Attendees:** Alex Rivera (Larkspur Labs), JJ (Larkspur Labs), Marcus Webb (Halden Freight), Aurelia Grant (Halden Freight), Sarah Okonkwo (Halden Freight)\n\n## Summary\n\nReview of the southern depots cutover on the Halden route optimizer migration, and a first meeting with Aurelia Grant, who joined Halden Freight in June as integration lead, replacing Ravi. Aurelia reports to Marcus.\n\n## Cutover\n\n- The southern depots cut over on July 20, three days later than planned because of a carrier data issue; it has been clean since. Nothing broke for drivers.\n- All regions are now on the new optimizer.\n\n## Decisions\n\n- **Decommission the old optimizer by September 30.**\n\n## Action items\n\n- **Aurelia Grant** — close out the rollback runbook by August 7. Ravi's draft was never finished, and the runbook is needed until decommission.\n- **Sarah Okonkwo** — renegotiate the old license termination by August 14; the license otherwise runs to the end of the year.\n- **Alex Rivera** — send Sarah a letter confirming the migration is complete, by Monday.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Ravi's recorded walkthrough of the depot mappings is on the shared drive; Aurelia has already watched it.\n- Aurelia prefers a quick call over long email threads.\n"
  },
